<details><summary>How does ChatGPT connect?<span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>Once your blog is ready, connect Dashless in ChatGPT. Draft, design, and review private previews through conversation. You approve what goes live. The ChatGPT connection is awaiting release.</p></details>
